{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from classic \u201990s 2D and early 3D shooters, Xentra Station combines old-school action with modern gameplay and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a member of an elite emergency response team, sent to investigate a sudden communication blackout at Xentra Station on a distant planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll discover powerful suit upgrades, unlock unique abilities, and equip a wide arsenal of specialized weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is filled with hidden passages, secrets, and a diverse range of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Survive. Uncover the horrors of Xentra Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503310?t=1765815920","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503310?t=1765815920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503310/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765815920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503310/6807276d537aec941b197275317ef213d864acd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765815920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4067970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xentra Station</strong> is a retro 2D shooting game set in a mysterious and atmospheric futuristic alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from classic \u201990s 2D and early 3D shooters, Xentra Station combines old-school action with modern gameplay and horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a member of an elite emergency response team, sent to investigate a sudden communication blackout at Xentra Station on a distant planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll discover powerful suit upgrades, unlock unique abilities, and equip a wide arsenal of specialized weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location is filled with hidden passages, secrets, and a diverse range of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore. Survive. Uncover the horrors of Xentra Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Klemen Zagar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503310/e2b9b065038ebfcf620955a8d95642b9a927a3eb/header.jpg?t=1765815920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503310/508677953/bfae96966c96e65ee30ab403635a5f9c3be42dbf/1756143857/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756147549","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503310/508677953/bfae96966c96e65ee30ab403635a5f9c3be42dbf/1756143857/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756147549","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503310/508677953/bfae96966c96e65ee30ab403635a5f9c3be42dbf/1756143857/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756147549","id":257188622,"name":"gameplay 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188622/0ee4d111f57e5f44553c7cd7eb9dbb83b2093b81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756147549"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3503310/1560921521/6f04f0e6dbac43b4a1a8a6fcd99e2b463183f8a7/1750856463/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755186225","dash_h264":"ht